mm3-recomp-arm64
================

ARM64 Linux port of mm3-recomp: patches, scripts and a launcher that build
Midtown Madness 3 on an ARM64 handheld from the player's own disc.

This repository's own files are licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 (LICENSE), the licence of the project they patch.

It builds on, and its patches modify:

- mm3-recomp, https://github.com/MattSG/mm3-recomp
  Copyright the mm3-recomp contributors. GPL-3.0-only.
- xboxrecomp (MattSG's fork, https://github.com/MattSG/xboxrecomp, of
  https://github.com/sp00nznet/xboxrecomp)
  Copyright (c) 2026 sp00nz and contributors. MIT; the parts derived from
  xemu are LGPL-2.1-or-later (tools/xboxrecomp/LICENSES in the source).

The launcher's source payload also carries, unmodified:

- RmlUi 6.3, https://github.com/mikke89/RmlUi (MIT)
- FreeType 2.13.3, https://freetype.org (FreeType License)

The ARM64 sysroot the launcher downloads (releases named sysroot-*) holds
Ubuntu 24.04 arm64 packages, each with its licence in usr/share/doc, and
builds of:

- DXVK 2.7.1, https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk (zlib licence)
- vkd3d 2.0, https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/vkd3d (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

On the handheld the launcher also downloads, from their own publishers, LLVM
(Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception), CMake (BSD-3-Clause), Ninja (Apache-2.0),
Python (PSF-2.0, python-build-standalone), Capstone (BSD-3-Clause) and
Pillow (MIT-CMU).

